1
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:10,560
PREVIOUSLY

2
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:12,840
-Chayanee.
-Don't raise your voice at me.

3
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:16,000
I was asking her to help campaign for me.

4
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,480
I told you

5
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:20,120
not to have Hathaya campaign for you.

6
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:22,400
Why do you want to help him

7
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:24,840
after the way he's treated you?

8
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:27,360
I want Papang to be proud of his dad.

9
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,800
I want you

10
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:32,680
to get close to Hathai.

11
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:36,200
There are all kinds of scammers
out there these days.

12
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,360
Be careful.

13
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:41,920
You got her all the way to the den.
Why did you let her leave?

14
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,360
I did everything I could, madam.

15
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,040
Wait.

16
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:48,240
Give me another chance. Do you know

17
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:51,040
I even went to a spa?

18
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:54,200
You can feel for yourself.

19
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:56,400
Actually, I'd like you

20
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,720
to feel my whole body.

21
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:02,000
Start here,

22
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,880
and slowly work your way down.

23
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:08,840
Why did you stop, madam?

24
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:16,959
I already told you. Whenever I come here,

25
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,440
close the door.

26
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:36,960
Of course.

27
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:51,480
Come on, everyone. Let's hear it
for our new subdistrict chief,

28
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,240
Chief Raiwin.

29
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:55,200
Thank you very much, everyone.

30
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,600
I promise

31
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,240
I will move forward with everything

32
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,760
I pledged during the campaign.

33
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,560
I'll improve quality of life,

34
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:05,280
create income opportunities,
and promote education.

35
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:07,280
I want everyone to have
the knowledge and skills

36
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:09,640
to support their own families.

37
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:12,560
Let's hear it for our new
subdistrict chief. A chief for the people.

38
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:16,560
Chief Raiwin. Come on, applaud.

39
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,720
Mr. Raiwin.

40
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:21,080
There are reports that vote-buying
took place during this election.

41
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,240
What do you say to that?

42
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,720
I admit there was vote-buying.

43
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:31,920
Miss Chayanee, is that true?

44
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,280
But not by Chief Raiwin.

45
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,760
Raiwin

46
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:40,440
worked incredibly hard
and ran an honest campaign.

47
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:44,200
He went door to door until I don't even
know how many pairs of shoes he wore out.

48
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:49,000
I promise you, and I give you my word,

49
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:50,840
that the two of us will make sure

50
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,600
everyone can live well and prosper.

51
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,120
Indeed.

52
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:59,000
Applaud. A chief for the people.

53
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:01,040
-Applaud.
-Applaud, everyone.

54
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,920
A chief for the people.

55
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,400
Applaud.

56
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:06,680
Applaud. Come on.

57
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:07,920
Hey, Ramil.

58
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:08,880
Hello, big brother.

59
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:10,640
-Thanks.
-Hello, everyone.

60
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:13,640
I'm the subdistrict chief's
younger brother.

61
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,760
Thank you.

62
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:20,240
I'm here to congratulate him
as his brother.

63
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:23,560
And from this point on,

64
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:25,760
I'm going to do my duty as a good citizen.

65
00:06:25,840 --> 00:06:27,600
What do you mean by that, Mr. Ramil?

66
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:32,320
Being a good citizen
doesn't end with voting.

67
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:34,360
From now on,

68
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:37,360
I'm going to scrutinize everything
the subdistrict chief does.

69
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:41,560
Every baht he spends is taxpayers' money.

70
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:46,360
And please help spread the word.
If anyone has information

71
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:48,720
about misconduct or corruption,

72
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:52,480
you can contact me directly.
I'll gladly act as an intermediary.

73
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:54,960
Doesn't doing that suggest

74
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:58,000
you don't trust your own brother?

75
00:06:58,080 --> 00:07:01,280
Not at all. The subdistrict chief,

76
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:03,400
Mr. Saksit,

77
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:06,920
and Miss Chayanee all promised
to follow through on their policies

78
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,520
and commitments.

79
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:10,280
So there's nothing

80
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:12,840
to worry about.

81
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,080
Right?

82
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:18,040
Right?

83
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:22,640
Then let's get a photo
of everyone together.

84
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,400
Yes. Here.

85
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,640
Stand a little closer.

86
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:28,200
Former subdistrict chief, come join us.

87
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:36,960
Come over here, Chief.

88
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,720
A little closer.

89
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:43,240
Beautiful. One more.

90
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:45,920
One, two, three.

91
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
Very good. Great.

92
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:50,440
Perfect.

93
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:57,000
I'm just doing what's right.

94
00:07:57,760 --> 00:08:01,240
You've done your duty as a citizen.
Let's go back to work.

95
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:02,400
Ramil.

96
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:08,120
Uncle, keep your voice down.

97
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:11,480
The reporters might write

98
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,960
that our family is fighting.

99
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:16,000
Is this how people who love
each other behave?

100
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:19,040
What you're doing

101
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,520
isn't something family does.

102
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:24,040
You already see me as a parasite anyway.

103
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,880
I'm not really family to you.

104
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:30,200
I'm just doing my duty as a good citizen.

105
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,840
Good citizen, my ass.

106
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:34,440
You're looking for a chance
to catch me doing something wrong.

107
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,840
You're trying to hurt us.

108
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:38,000
You've been in politics so long

109
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:40,200
that you think you're untouchable.

110
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:43,440
But the world has changed.
You can buy votes,

111
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:45,680
but you don't control everyone.

112
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:50,440
Everyone has a phone now.

113
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:52,960
And from now on,

114
00:08:53,040 --> 00:08:56,400
this is the weapon people
will use against old-school,

115
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,840
power-hungry figures like you.

116
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,600
Dad.

117
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:04,320
Don't. The reporters are still around.

118
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,040
Ramil.

119
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:09,840
I promise I won't stray
from the right path.

120
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:14,080
I'll work hard and show the people that

121
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:15,760
I came here to serve them.

122
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,320
I'll be watching.

123
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,680
Uncle, don't waste your time on them.

124
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:30,680
Ungrateful parasites.

125
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:34,720
Everything Chayanee said
is absolutely right.

126
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,240
She said exactly what I was thinking.

127
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:41,840
He's jealous

128
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:44,600
because my son is rising in the world.

129
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:50,520
How about we go
somewhere nice and have a meal?

130
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:53,880
We'll celebrate our new subdistrict chief.

131
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:59,440
Good idea. Let's go
somewhere nice and expensive

132
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:02,400
for my chief.

133
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,440
-Come on.
-Let's go.

134
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:23,120
Yai, have you eaten yet?

135
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:27,440
Are you angry with me about something?

136
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,480
You haven't read my messages in days.

137
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,880
Ms. Hathai. Ms. Hathai.

138
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:44,640
The soup is boiling. Ms. Hathai.

139
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:47,880
What? Did it burn?

140
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,320
Not yet.

141
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:53,840
Is something bothering you?

142
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:56,400
No.

143
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:01,080
Madam Hathai,

144
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:03,040
is Father's food ready yet?

145
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:05,120
I've already prepared it.
You can take it out.

146
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,080
Where's the rice?

147
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:13,920
I forgot.

148
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:19,560
No rice? Is Father
supposed to feast on air?

149
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:27,520
Madam, do you think Ms. Hathai
ate something that disagreed with her?

150
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:28,640
Oh.

151
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:31,440
Or is something troubling her?

152
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:33,880
She looks so gloomy.

153
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:34,800
Oh?

154
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:39,280
Almost like someone with a broken heart.

155
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:43,120
Chamoi, you really just say
whatever comes into your head.

156
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:47,880
Ever since Hathai became a widow,

157
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:51,080
I haven't seen her
get involved with any man.

158
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:52,160
Really?

159
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:55,280
Madam, I saw her the other day.

160
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:58,280
She was chatting on her phone
and giggling away.

161
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:02,240
But these past few days,

162
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:05,680
she's been sitting there
chatting all by herself.

163
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:09,320
No giggling. No smiling. For days.

164
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,920
Wait.

165
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,400
Don't stay a widow too long.

166
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:17,520
You don't have that many years left.
Enjoy your life.

167
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:20,000
Find yourself a new husband

168
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:22,200
and get far away from me.

169
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:27,400
Good luck. I'm rooting for you.

170
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:50,000
Ann, finish setting everything up for me.

171
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,120
Of course.

172
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:58,200
Hello, Yai.

173
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:03,960
You ignored my messages.
I thought you were done with me.

174
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:08,240
Not at all.
I've been overseas constantly lately.

175
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:11,160
Right now I'm taking care
of the minister's family again.

176
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:15,920
And on my next trip, I have to take care
of the PM's family too.

177
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:20,480
I'm glad you contacted me.

178
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:24,880
I thought you were angry

179
00:13:25,560 --> 00:13:27,400
because I wouldn't stay with you that day.

180
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:30,280
Not at all. I don't want to pressure you.

181
00:13:30,880 --> 00:13:32,440
Will we

182
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,560
get to see each other again?

183
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:40,120
When I get back from Italy,

184
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:43,280
I'll probably relax with my friends
at the same place again.

185
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:47,960
But I know
you don't like places like that.

186
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,360
I shouldn't pressure you.

187
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,600
I have to go, Hathai.

188
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:56,760
The minister's wife just arrived.

189
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,440
All right.

190
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:03,720
You let the fish get away this time.

191
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:06,880
Next time, don't let it slip off the hook.

192
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:09,480
I'm still playing mind games with her.

193
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:13,240
But I don't know
if I'm doing it well enough.

194
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:19,320
Maybe you could teach me, madam.

195
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:36,080
I want to see you again.

196
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:47,760
Where are you going?
It isn't lunch break yet.

197
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:51,640
Miss Chayanee's treating everyone
since her boyfriend was elected chief.

198
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,600
Come with us.

199
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:55,440
That's okay. I still haven't finished
going through the accounts.

200
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:57,680
All right. I'll bring you something back.

201
00:14:57,760 --> 00:14:58,920
Thank you.

202
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:16,880
Thank you.

203
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:19,040
You shouldn't be in here.

204
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:20,920
I brought you some food.

205
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:24,680
But Chayanee won't see it that way.
I don't want any trouble.

206
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:28,400
We got so much.

207
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:29,560
We can split it.

208
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:32,320
Wait. Have you seen my boyfriend?

209
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:35,200
Mr. Raiwin took some food into the office.

210
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:36,760
For who?

211
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:39,240
Miss Hathaya.

212
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:42,200
Hathaya.

213
00:15:46,760 --> 00:15:49,160
Thank you for the food,

214
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:50,600
but you should go, Raiwin.

215
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:52,760
Don't worry so much about what she thinks.

216
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:55,240
There's nothing inappropriate
about me talking to you.

217
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:58,440
Then if you won't leave,

218
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,400
I will.

219
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:04,080
Hathaya.

220
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:13,360
Hathaya.

221
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:14,960
Listen to me first.

222
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:18,040
Do you know why I still
have feelings for you?

223
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:21,840
Because you care about
other people's feelings.

224
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:25,920
And you're the only woman
who ever really listens to me.

225
00:16:27,760 --> 00:16:29,800
Please let go of my hand.

226
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:32,560
I should never have let Ramil have you.

227
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:34,800
What are you talking about?

228
00:16:34,880 --> 00:16:36,800
You're with Chayanee.

229
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:38,720
If I could,

230
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:40,480
I'd break up with her.

231
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:48,280
I'm telling you the truth.
When I'm with you, when I talk to you,

232
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,440
I feel at ease.

233
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:57,400
But when I'm with Chayanee,
I feel like a prisoner.

234
00:16:58,080 --> 00:17:01,560
She controls everything I do.
I can't be myself at all.

235
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:07,839
My whole life, I've lived
under my father's shadow.

236
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:09,520
I hoped that when I grew up,

237
00:17:09,599 --> 00:17:13,000
I'd finally have a life of my own. That I
could become a good head of my family.

238
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:17,280
But being with Chayanee is even worse.

239
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:21,720
One day, if I can't take it anymore,

240
00:17:23,079 --> 00:17:24,640
I'll probably…

241
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:28,400
You'll probably what?

242
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:34,480
I asked

243
00:17:35,760 --> 00:17:37,040
what you'll do.

244
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,400
Say it!

245
00:17:40,280 --> 00:17:42,000
Go on.

246
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:44,360
I just brought some food for Hathaya.

247
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:48,960
Let's go hand out the food.

248
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,360
Come here.

249
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:59,640
Chaya. Why did you slap me?

250
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,400
You still have the nerve to ask?

251
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:04,040
You're trying to steal Raiwin from me.

252
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:06,720
You flirted with him
and turned him against me.

253
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:07,920
That's why he said such crazy stuff.

254
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:09,600
That has nothing to do with me.

255
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:11,880
It has everything to do with you.

256
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:14,680
You're jealous because I'm going
to be the chief's wife.

257
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:16,240
You're trying to take all I have.

258
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:18,080
Hey!

259
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,840
-Chayanee! Stop!
-Let go!

260
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:21,280
Let go!

261
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:24,320
If you try to stop me, I'll assume
you're protecting your mistress.

262
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:28,960
You slapped me?

263
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:31,200
I'm trying to knock some sense into you.

264
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:33,120
Stop acting crazy, Chayanee.

265
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,800
You think I'm crazy?

266
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:39,200
-Then I'll show you crazy.
-Chaya, don't.

267
00:18:39,280 --> 00:18:40,640
Chaya, stop.

268
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:42,840
Chayanee, stop!

269
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:45,120
Back off! Stay out of this.

270
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,960
I hate you.

271
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:50,200
You're trying to take everything
from me. I hate you!

272
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:51,520
Stop!

273
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:52,720
Let go.

274
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:57,680
Let go. You!

275
00:18:58,280 --> 00:18:59,440
-Come here.
-Raiwin,

276
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:02,680
get your woman out of here. Get her out!

277
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:05,040
-Let go.
-Come here. Come on.

278
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,360
-Let me go.
-Get out here.

279
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:08,360
I hate you. I hate you!

280
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:11,160
I'll kill you!

281
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:13,520
Hathaya.

282
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:15,400
Are you okay?

283
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:38,800
-Let go.
-Stop, Chayanee.

284
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:41,320
Stop. Calm down. Get a grip.

285
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:44,280
She was trying to steal you.

286
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:46,960
She slapped me.
You have to press charges against her.

287
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:50,520
You're the subdistrict chief now.
You have to make her pay.

288
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:52,640
She was defending herself.

289
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:54,120
You started it.

290
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:57,280
But you're my boyfriend.
You're supposed to take my side.

291
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:59,000
Listen to me.

292
00:20:00,280 --> 00:20:01,720
I've only just taken office.

293
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:04,720
If damaging rumors come out now,
who's going to respect me?

294
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:07,640
Stop thinking only about yourself.

295
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:09,960
Think about me for once.

296
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:11,320
Do you understand?

297
00:20:13,680 --> 00:20:15,560
You don't love me anymore.

298
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:18,120
You're going to leave me.

299
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:22,800
Tell me.

300
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:25,880
Tell me you still love me.

301
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:29,320
Say it.

302
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:31,280
Tell me!

303
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,160
I still love you.

304
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:38,280
I love you too.

305
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:40,640
Please don't leave me.

306
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:11,680
Sorry. It's you.

307
00:21:15,040 --> 00:21:16,080
Does it

308
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,040
hurt badly?

309
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:20,760
Just a little.

310
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:24,360
Chayanee worries me.

311
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:27,680
She gets more spoiled every day.

312
00:21:27,760 --> 00:21:29,480
Now she can't even control herself.

313
00:21:30,360 --> 00:21:32,280
Aunt Liu only has one daughter.

314
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:36,280
Whatever Chayanee wanted, she always got.

315
00:21:38,120 --> 00:21:40,720
No one has ever been allowed
to tell her no.

316
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:44,600
I never wanted trouble with her either.

317
00:21:47,360 --> 00:21:50,240
But I can't keep letting her off the hook.

318
00:21:52,360 --> 00:21:53,920
What you did

319
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:56,000
was right.

320
00:21:56,600 --> 00:22:00,040
Someone has to teach her right from wrong.

321
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:02,480
Otherwise, people like her

322
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:04,480
will cause problems for society.

323
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:09,920
So…

324
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:12,520
I'll…

325
00:22:15,600 --> 00:22:16,760
press this on for you.

326
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:19,400
Oh.

327
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:24,520
Okay.

328
00:22:45,040 --> 00:22:46,600
That hurts a little.

329
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:48,320
Sorry.

330
00:22:49,040 --> 00:22:50,360
I've never done this before.

331
00:23:24,880 --> 00:23:26,600
-Aunt Ann.
-Yes?

332
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:28,040
Have you seen Mom?

333
00:23:28,120 --> 00:23:29,640
Madam?

334
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:31,720
I saw her heading toward the main house.

335
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:34,920
It's already dark.
What is she doing over there?

336
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:36,560
If I had to guess,

337
00:23:36,640 --> 00:23:39,760
she's probably going to deal
with Miss Chayanee

338
00:23:39,840 --> 00:23:41,040
for hurting you.

339
00:23:49,600 --> 00:23:51,120
Madam.

340
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:54,280
Here. Soy milk from that delicious place,

341
00:23:54,360 --> 00:23:57,960
with big, dense fried dough sticks.
You'll be stuffed.

342
00:23:58,040 --> 00:23:59,040
Today,

343
00:23:59,120 --> 00:24:01,600
I don't need your soy milk.

344
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:04,360
I'm already satisfied.

345
00:24:06,800 --> 00:24:09,720
Madam, what got into you?

346
00:24:11,840 --> 00:24:12,920
Where's your daughter?

347
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:14,520
Why should I tell you?

348
00:24:15,360 --> 00:24:18,640
Where my daughter goes is her business.

349
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:19,680
What's that to you?

350
00:24:19,760 --> 00:24:21,880
Your daughter slapped mine.

351
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:23,080
What are you saying?

352
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:25,000
Your daughter slapped my daughter.

353
00:24:25,080 --> 00:24:27,240
She tried to stab her with scissors too.

354
00:24:27,320 --> 00:24:29,840
I didn't know. Well?

355
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:32,320
How is your daughter? Is she dead yet?

356
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:34,960
I can reserve a funeral pavilion for you.

357
00:24:35,040 --> 00:24:37,680
There are a lot of funerals lately.

358
00:24:37,760 --> 00:24:41,080
Without connections, it's hard to get one.

359
00:24:42,080 --> 00:24:44,640
If you can't get a pavilion,

360
00:24:44,720 --> 00:24:46,800
why not bury her
and use her as fertilizer?

361
00:24:50,320 --> 00:24:51,680
-How could you?
-Are you crazy?

362
00:24:52,840 --> 00:24:54,320
Stop!

363
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:55,280
How could you?

364
00:24:58,600 --> 00:25:00,240
Your daughter

365
00:25:00,320 --> 00:25:02,240
did something wrong.
She slapped my daughter.

366
00:25:02,320 --> 00:25:03,960
Instead of feeling guilty,

367
00:25:04,040 --> 00:25:06,400
you sit here laughing and enjoying it.

368
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:09,400
Now I understand why
your daughter is so vicious.

369
00:25:09,480 --> 00:25:11,520
She has a mother like you.

370
00:25:11,600 --> 00:25:12,560
No conscience at all.

371
00:25:12,640 --> 00:25:14,400
You're nothing but garbage to society.

372
00:25:14,480 --> 00:25:15,720
That's enough.

373
00:25:15,800 --> 00:25:18,040
I sent my daughter
to good schools and raised her

374
00:25:18,120 --> 00:25:20,800
like a proper lady. Not like
you low-class people who went

375
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:24,040
to temple schools. Your classroom was
probably right next to the crematorium.

376
00:25:24,120 --> 00:25:26,720
No wonder wandering evil spirits

377
00:25:26,800 --> 00:25:29,480
possessed you and made you act so trashy.

378
00:25:30,120 --> 00:25:31,920
Exactly. So low-class.

379
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,880
She uses violence to solve everything.

380
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:34,840
Madam.

381
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:37,680
Madam, don't fight back.
We're civilized people.

382
00:25:37,760 --> 00:25:40,600
We'll let the law handle her.

383
00:25:41,200 --> 00:25:42,520
The law?

384
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:44,400
Are you crazy?!

385
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:46,080
Too bad I don't have a pestle.

386
00:25:46,160 --> 00:25:48,040
I'd shove it down your throat.

387
00:25:48,120 --> 00:25:50,960
You vile, low-class trash.

388
00:25:51,040 --> 00:25:53,400
I'm calling the police
and having them drag you away.

389
00:25:53,480 --> 00:25:56,080
Here, madam.

390
00:25:56,160 --> 00:25:57,440
Call them. Call right now.

391
00:25:57,520 --> 00:25:59,920
Go ahead. Call.

392
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:02,840
At worst, what I did
is a minor assault case.

393
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:04,240
A small fine, a few hundred tops.

394
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:06,440
But your daughter,

395
00:26:06,520 --> 00:26:08,200
attempted murder.

396
00:26:08,280 --> 00:26:11,200
Think about what she could be facing.

397
00:26:13,040 --> 00:26:14,400
Go on. Call.

398
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:16,840
Madam, call. If you won't,

399
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:18,040
I will.

400
00:26:18,120 --> 00:26:19,360
Don't challenge the system.

401
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:20,800
Hello? Hello?

402
00:26:20,880 --> 00:26:22,800
Hey!

403
00:26:22,880 --> 00:26:24,360
Where is your daughter?

404
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:27,360
I asked where she is.

405
00:26:28,080 --> 00:26:30,480
-Mom.
-Get her and make her apologize.

406
00:26:30,560 --> 00:26:33,040
Mom. Mom, stop.
I don't want any more trouble.

407
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:35,760
Don't give in to them.

408
00:26:35,840 --> 00:26:39,480
Today she only slapped you.
What is she going to do next time?

409
00:26:40,080 --> 00:26:42,320
Chaya probably won't dare
do anything again, Mom.

410
00:26:43,520 --> 00:26:44,640
Aunt Liu.

411
00:26:45,600 --> 00:26:48,400
I think you should take
Chayanee to see a psychiatrist.

412
00:26:48,480 --> 00:26:49,600
It's time

413
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:52,800
someone properly helped her
deal with what's going on.

414
00:26:53,960 --> 00:26:56,480
Are you calling my daughter crazy?

415
00:26:56,560 --> 00:26:57,880
Aunt Liu.

416
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:59,840
You need to change that way of thinking.

417
00:26:59,920 --> 00:27:03,360
Seeing a psychiatrist
doesn't mean someone is crazy.

418
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:05,520
You raised Chayanee.

419
00:27:05,600 --> 00:27:08,800
You know what her personality
and temper are like.

420
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:11,120
Please listen to me before it's too late.

421
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:15,800
And I'm warning both of you.

422
00:27:15,880 --> 00:27:18,640
Stay away from my daughter.

423
00:27:18,720 --> 00:27:21,840
If anyone hurts her again,

424
00:27:21,920 --> 00:27:24,520
next time I won't stop at slapping.

425
00:27:26,320 --> 00:27:27,320
What are you gonna do?

426
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:32,400
Try me and find out.

427
00:27:47,400 --> 00:27:48,640
Madam, calm down.

428
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:58,600
Mom. Don't do that again.

429
00:27:58,680 --> 00:28:01,120
If they press charges,
you could get in trouble.

430
00:28:01,200 --> 00:28:05,160
I don't care. They used violence first,
so I gave it back.

431
00:28:05,240 --> 00:28:07,120
An eye for an eye.

432
00:28:07,200 --> 00:28:09,600
I will never let anyone hurt my daughter.

433
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:12,160
Mom,

434
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:16,280
just knowing that you love me
and worry about me makes me happy.

435
00:28:16,360 --> 00:28:20,240
And you need to be careful.

436
00:28:20,320 --> 00:28:22,400
Her mother enables her this much.

437
00:28:22,480 --> 00:28:25,280
Chayanee isn't going to let this go.

438
00:28:25,360 --> 00:28:28,600
I know. I'll be much more careful.

439
00:28:30,920 --> 00:28:32,640
I'm still furious.

440
00:28:35,560 --> 00:28:37,040
Aunt Ann, what is it?

441
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:40,920
I wanted to talk to you

442
00:28:41,000 --> 00:28:42,400
about Madam Hathai.

443
00:28:42,480 --> 00:28:44,080
Did Mom cause another problem?

444
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:46,240
She hasn't done anything wrong,

445
00:28:46,320 --> 00:28:50,720
but I think she may be
falling for that man.

446
00:28:51,640 --> 00:28:54,360
A few days ago, when he stopped
replying to her messages,

447
00:28:54,440 --> 00:28:56,640
she became really down.

448
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:58,440
Then the moment

449
00:28:58,520 --> 00:29:02,480
he replied, she brightened right up.

450
00:29:02,560 --> 00:29:03,840
I'm afraid

451
00:29:04,560 --> 00:29:07,440
she might get fooled by another man.

452
00:29:09,240 --> 00:29:11,240
Thank you so much for telling me.

453
00:29:11,320 --> 00:29:13,680
I'll keep an eye out
and make sure there's no trouble.

454
00:29:23,160 --> 00:29:25,400
Madam,

455
00:29:25,480 --> 00:29:27,880
Hathai is coming after you, right?

456
00:29:27,960 --> 00:29:29,440
Don't let her get away with it.

457
00:29:29,520 --> 00:29:30,920
Here. Use this.

458
00:29:31,960 --> 00:29:33,920
Chamoi. Get that thing away from me.

459
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:36,080
What if I snap and actually do it?

460
00:29:36,160 --> 00:29:37,960
You really are trying
to send me to prison.

461
00:29:38,040 --> 00:29:39,760
Oh, right.

462
00:29:41,200 --> 00:29:43,840
Mom. You have to deal with this for me.

463
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:45,240
We can't handle it, miss.

464
00:29:45,320 --> 00:29:48,200
Madam and I barely survived
dealing with them ourselves.

465
00:29:48,280 --> 00:29:52,200
Chayanee, did you really
intend to kill Hathaya?

466
00:29:52,280 --> 00:29:53,520
Yes.

467
00:29:54,120 --> 00:29:56,520
She's trying to steal Raiwin from me.

468
00:29:56,600 --> 00:29:58,600
She turned Raiwin against me

469
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:00,960
so badly that he wants
to break up with me.

470
00:30:01,040 --> 00:30:05,600
No wonder Hathai
was furious and came after me.

471
00:30:05,680 --> 00:30:07,440
She hurt you?

472
00:30:08,640 --> 00:30:11,240
Where are they?
I'll kill both mother and daughter.

473
00:30:11,320 --> 00:30:13,600
Wait. Stop.

474
00:30:13,680 --> 00:30:15,920
Enough. You started it.

475
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:18,760
If this gets any bigger,
Grandpa will hear about it.

476
00:30:18,840 --> 00:30:21,480
So you're just going to let them bully me?

477
00:30:21,560 --> 00:30:22,680
I hate her.

478
00:30:22,760 --> 00:30:25,360
I will never live
under the same roof with her.

479
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:26,760
I understand.

480
00:30:26,840 --> 00:30:28,600
But what can we use against her?

481
00:30:29,400 --> 00:30:31,240
Hathaya wants to steal Raiwin

482
00:30:32,480 --> 00:30:34,720
because she's desperate for a man.

483
00:30:34,800 --> 00:30:37,200
I'll give her all the men she can handle.

484
00:30:38,480 --> 00:30:39,680
What are you planning now?

485
00:30:53,640 --> 00:30:54,840
Hathaya.

486
00:30:56,120 --> 00:30:58,640
After you went home yesterday,
did Chayanee bother you again?

487
00:31:00,320 --> 00:31:02,520
You don't have to go
out of your way to drive me.

488
00:31:02,600 --> 00:31:04,040
It's fine.

489
00:31:04,120 --> 00:31:07,800
If anything happens, tell me.
Don't hesitate.

490
00:31:07,880 --> 00:31:08,880
I'm happy to help.

491
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:11,360
Thank you.

492
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:13,760
All right. I'm heading to work.

493
00:31:28,280 --> 00:31:30,200
Has Pong arrived yet, Mom?

494
00:31:30,280 --> 00:31:32,120
I already called him.

495
00:31:40,520 --> 00:31:43,760
I told you to find some rough men.
Where are they?

496
00:31:56,280 --> 00:31:57,560
Do you approve, miss?

497
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,640
If you succeed tonight,

498
00:32:10,440 --> 00:32:12,040
I'll give you a bonus.

499
00:32:15,240 --> 00:32:16,080
Thank you.

500
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:19,000
Everyone.

501
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:21,440
Get to work.

502
00:32:21,520 --> 00:32:25,120
Make yourselves worth the money. Go.

503
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:32,720
Savage.

504
00:32:34,040 --> 00:32:36,040
Chayanee.

505
00:32:36,120 --> 00:32:37,600
Isn't this going too far?

506
00:32:39,960 --> 00:32:41,640
It won't kill her.

507
00:32:42,440 --> 00:32:46,480
I want to scare her so badly that she'll
be afraid of men for the rest of her life.

508
00:33:01,560 --> 00:33:03,200
Come on. Faster. We're almost done.

509
00:33:06,720 --> 00:33:08,000
Boss.

510
00:33:08,080 --> 00:33:11,360
Pong brought in a whole group of workers.

511
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:14,040
Every one of these guys
has walked off the job before.

512
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:25,880
Why didn't you tell me

513
00:33:25,960 --> 00:33:27,320
before bringing these men back?

514
00:33:27,960 --> 00:33:31,160
I apologize, boss.

515
00:33:31,240 --> 00:33:34,040
You said I hadn't done the work properly,

516
00:33:34,120 --> 00:33:36,880
so I brought them back to fix everything.

517
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:40,760
And you don't have to pay them
a single baht.

518
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:43,160
No matter what you do,

519
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:48,160
you report it to me first. Every time.

520
00:33:49,840 --> 00:33:51,200
Then,

521
00:33:51,960 --> 00:33:54,840
I apologize again.

522
00:33:55,520 --> 00:33:58,600
But you're not heartless enough

523
00:33:58,680 --> 00:34:01,840
to throw out workers who realized
they were wrong and came back,

524
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:02,880
are you?

525
00:34:03,520 --> 00:34:05,000
They're already here.

526
00:34:05,080 --> 00:34:07,280
Finish the job.
Then don't come back again.

527
00:34:09,159 --> 00:34:11,679
Thank you so much, boss.

528
00:34:13,040 --> 00:34:14,120
You're the best.

529
00:34:14,920 --> 00:34:16,400
Come on.

530
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:18,960
Show some respect.

531
00:34:19,040 --> 00:34:20,719
Thank the boss.

532
00:34:20,800 --> 00:34:23,639
He's kind enough to let you keep working.

533
00:34:23,719 --> 00:34:25,159
Say thank you!

534
00:34:25,239 --> 00:34:29,280
-Thank you, boss.
-Thank you, boss.

535
00:34:44,199 --> 00:34:46,040
Keep an eye on them.

536
00:34:46,960 --> 00:34:48,360
I've got a bad feeling.

537
00:34:48,440 --> 00:34:50,159
Same here, boss.

538
00:34:50,800 --> 00:34:53,400
Showing up and working for free?

539
00:34:53,480 --> 00:34:55,080
Something's definitely wrong.

540
00:34:59,440 --> 00:35:02,120
I'm done with work. I'll come meet you
at the construction site.

541
00:35:02,880 --> 00:35:04,000
Okay.

542
00:35:05,280 --> 00:35:07,080
Miss Hathaya,

543
00:35:07,160 --> 00:35:08,560
I'm really sorry.

544
00:35:08,640 --> 00:35:11,760
I forgot to give you the accounts.
Could you finish checking them today?

545
00:35:11,840 --> 00:35:14,000
I have to submit the report
to Mr. Pichai tomorrow.

546
00:35:16,120 --> 00:35:18,440
Sure. I'll take care of it.

547
00:35:19,440 --> 00:35:21,360
-I'm sorry.
-It's okay.

548
00:35:34,160 --> 00:35:35,440
Keep your mouth shut.

549
00:35:37,040 --> 00:35:37,880
Yes.

550
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:51,000
Pong. Why are you still here?

551
00:35:51,080 --> 00:35:53,960
I want to go home more than anyone, boss.

552
00:35:54,040 --> 00:35:55,280
I've been working all day.

553
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:58,520
But I promised you I'd finish this.

554
00:35:58,600 --> 00:36:00,880
Even if I have to work through the night,

555
00:36:00,960 --> 00:36:02,560
I'm going to get it done.

556
00:36:02,640 --> 00:36:05,480
There's a birthday party
for one of the workers tonight.

557
00:36:05,560 --> 00:36:07,280
You should go. I'll watch these guys.

558
00:36:08,840 --> 00:36:10,080
No.

559
00:36:11,040 --> 00:36:12,440
You go on my behalf.

560
00:36:13,720 --> 00:36:14,840
I'll stay here.

561
00:36:15,880 --> 00:36:17,480
Wow, boss.

562
00:36:17,560 --> 00:36:19,360
I feel terrible making you do that.

563
00:36:19,440 --> 00:36:21,520
Anyway, I'm off. I'll eat extra for you.

564
00:36:21,600 --> 00:36:24,360
You should've told me sooner
instead of making me stand here.

565
00:36:31,920 --> 00:36:34,440
Boss, you're still here?

566
00:36:36,720 --> 00:36:40,600
You're sacrificing your valuable time
just to watch us work.

567
00:36:40,680 --> 00:36:42,640
Hey, guys.

568
00:36:43,240 --> 00:36:45,520
Show the boss what you can do.

569
00:36:45,600 --> 00:36:47,600
Show him how good we are.

570
00:36:48,720 --> 00:36:51,680
-Yes, boss.
-Yes, boss.

571
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:04,680
Mom.

572
00:37:06,560 --> 00:37:08,320
You came in so quietly. You scared me.

573
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:11,360
I saw that you still hadn't come home,
so I came to pick you up.

574
00:37:12,240 --> 00:37:14,680
You're still not done?

575
00:37:14,760 --> 00:37:16,440
I got a little extra work.

576
00:37:17,280 --> 00:37:19,400
I'm happy for you.

577
00:37:19,480 --> 00:37:22,040
Grandpa trusts you enough
to let you handle the accounts.

578
00:37:24,120 --> 00:37:27,920
Keep working. I'll sit here and wait.
Then we can go home together.

579
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:29,120
Okay.

580
00:37:31,800 --> 00:37:33,880
You can charge your phone.
The outlet's over there.

581
00:37:33,960 --> 00:37:35,160
Yes?

582
00:37:37,440 --> 00:37:38,680
Madam.

583
00:37:39,320 --> 00:37:41,480
Hathai is sitting there
watching over her daughter.

584
00:37:43,720 --> 00:37:45,000
What a nuisance.

585
00:37:45,640 --> 00:37:49,440
If her mother stays with her,
my whole plan is ruined.

586
00:37:49,520 --> 00:37:51,920
No, it isn't. I'll have Yai

587
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:53,960
lure Hathai away.

588
00:37:54,040 --> 00:37:55,440
Who's Yai?

589
00:37:56,040 --> 00:37:57,080
Pong.

590
00:38:02,600 --> 00:38:03,880
Pong.

591
00:38:03,960 --> 00:38:05,600
Call Hathai right now.

592
00:38:05,680 --> 00:38:07,240
Tick her into leaving the office.

593
00:38:09,240 --> 00:38:11,960
I'm back. Come have dinner with me.

594
00:38:12,040 --> 00:38:15,000
I bought you a designer handbag.

595
00:38:15,080 --> 00:38:17,080
But I'm only free tonight.

596
00:38:17,600 --> 00:38:19,240
I really want to see you.

597
00:38:22,640 --> 00:38:24,080
Did that man message you, Mom?

598
00:38:25,720 --> 00:38:27,000
No.

599
00:38:27,080 --> 00:38:29,400
Mom. I'm serious.

600
00:38:30,040 --> 00:38:33,960
There's something strange about that man.
I don't really trust him.

601
00:38:36,520 --> 00:38:41,080
It's an old friend of mine
from back when I had the restaurant.

602
00:38:41,160 --> 00:38:42,480
And

603
00:38:42,560 --> 00:38:46,560
she's moving to Italy with her husband,
so she invited me out to dinner.

604
00:38:46,640 --> 00:38:48,040
Oh?

605
00:38:48,120 --> 00:38:51,600
Then go. I can go home with Ramil.

606
00:38:52,440 --> 00:38:53,480
You sure?

607
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:58,800
Then I'll go.

608
00:38:58,880 --> 00:39:01,200
-Have fun.
-Okay.

609
00:39:25,840 --> 00:39:27,520
A man sends her a few messages

610
00:39:27,600 --> 00:39:29,120
and she leaves her girl immediately.

611
00:39:29,200 --> 00:39:33,080
Right? Madam, don't ever be like that.

612
00:39:33,680 --> 00:39:35,200
Chamoi.

613
00:39:36,120 --> 00:39:38,840
So what do we do next?

614
00:39:39,440 --> 00:39:41,640
Mom, call Pong and tell him to move now.

615
00:39:42,280 --> 00:39:43,720
Get Ramil out of the way.

616
00:39:47,240 --> 00:39:48,760
Tomorrow, clean up this whole area.

617
00:39:49,480 --> 00:39:50,560
Yeah.

618
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:55,040
Everything's done, boss.

619
00:39:55,680 --> 00:39:59,280
I did it perfectly.

620
00:39:59,360 --> 00:40:00,480
Feel free inspect it.

621
00:40:01,400 --> 00:40:03,080
Thanks for fixing it.

622
00:40:03,160 --> 00:40:05,680
But next time,

623
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:07,360
do it properly the first time.

624
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:10,040
So neither of us wastes time fixing it.

625
00:40:11,560 --> 00:40:14,720
Then I sincerely apologize, boss.

626
00:40:14,800 --> 00:40:17,240
Truly. From the bottom of my heart.

627
00:40:17,320 --> 00:40:20,240
Come on. Apologize to the boss.

628
00:40:20,320 --> 00:40:22,360
Even after you screwed up,
he still forgave you.

629
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:24,520
-Apologize.
-We're sorry.

630
00:40:24,600 --> 00:40:26,360
-We're sorry.
-We're sorry.

631
00:40:26,440 --> 00:40:28,320
That's more like it.

632
00:40:30,160 --> 00:40:31,800
May I head home now?

633
00:40:31,880 --> 00:40:36,400
I want a good night's sleep so I can
do great work for you tomorrow.

634
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:38,560
Good night, boss.

635
00:40:40,440 --> 00:40:43,400
-Good night, boss.
-Good night, boss.

636
00:40:56,920 --> 00:40:57,960
Hello.

637
00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:00,560
Yes, this is Ramil.

638
00:41:02,120 --> 00:41:03,120
What?

639
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:05,640
One of my workers had an accident?

640
00:41:05,720 --> 00:41:07,160
He hit a ten-wheeler?

641
00:41:07,840 --> 00:41:09,680
All right. I'm coming right now.

642
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:18,840
Wow.

643
00:41:18,920 --> 00:41:21,520
You guys are damn good actors.

644
00:41:21,600 --> 00:41:25,000
Maybe I should nominate you
for Best Supporting Actor.

645
00:41:25,080 --> 00:41:25,960
How about that?

646
00:41:26,040 --> 00:41:27,160
Sounds good, boss.

647
00:41:29,120 --> 00:41:30,160
Come on.

648
00:41:30,680 --> 00:41:32,000
Let's go have some fun.

649
00:41:32,080 --> 00:41:33,280
Let's go.

650
00:41:33,360 --> 00:41:34,560
Come on.

651
00:41:35,560 --> 00:41:37,560
Go take care of your worker first.

652
00:41:37,640 --> 00:41:39,800
Don't worry about me.
When I'm done, I'll come find you.

653
00:41:40,880 --> 00:41:42,560
Okay. Okay.

654
00:42:54,480 --> 00:42:55,720
Come here!

655
00:43:00,680 --> 00:43:01,640
Hey! Hey!

656
00:43:01,720 --> 00:43:02,680
Quickly!

657
00:43:02,760 --> 00:43:04,280
Hurry up!

658
00:43:05,880 --> 00:43:07,080
Go.

659
00:43:13,600 --> 00:43:16,520
Madam, Hathaya got away.

660
00:43:16,600 --> 00:43:17,600
She won't get far.

661
00:43:17,680 --> 00:43:21,120
Chayanee, I think
this is getting too violent.

662
00:43:21,200 --> 00:43:22,840
This could turn into something serious.

663
00:43:22,920 --> 00:43:24,640
Call Pong and tell him to stop.

664
00:43:24,720 --> 00:43:26,680
We can't stop now, Mom.

665
00:43:26,760 --> 00:43:30,120
She hurt me. She has to pay.

666
00:43:56,960 --> 00:43:59,600
Let go of me!

667
00:44:01,200 --> 00:44:05,160
Chayanee, let's go home.
I feel awful about this.

668
00:44:07,000 --> 00:44:08,040
Madam.

669
00:44:08,120 --> 00:44:10,200
Madam. Look over there.

670
00:44:10,280 --> 00:44:13,520
Ramil came back to help Hathaya.

671
00:44:14,960 --> 00:44:16,680
What do we do?

672
00:44:25,000 --> 00:44:26,640
The office is closed.

673
00:44:26,720 --> 00:44:28,000
I came to pick up Hathaya.

674
00:44:28,080 --> 00:44:29,560
Hathaya already went home.

675
00:44:29,640 --> 00:44:30,760
You saw her leave?

676
00:44:30,840 --> 00:44:32,880
Yes. I saw her go home.

677
00:44:32,960 --> 00:44:35,920
You should leave too.
Stop hanging around here.

678
00:44:36,000 --> 00:44:39,520
If anything goes missing, I'll assume
you came here to steal from my office.

679
00:44:43,120 --> 00:44:44,080
Hathaya.

680
00:44:47,320 --> 00:44:48,280
Oh?

681
00:44:49,720 --> 00:44:51,560
I told you the office was closed.

682
00:44:52,880 --> 00:44:53,880
What happened here?

683
00:44:55,320 --> 00:44:56,920
Probably a break-in.

684
00:44:57,000 --> 00:44:58,880
Go home. I'll call the police.

685
00:44:58,960 --> 00:45:00,480
No.

686
00:45:00,560 --> 00:45:01,840
Hathaya was here.

687
00:45:02,880 --> 00:45:04,960
Hathaya. Hathaya.

688
00:45:05,040 --> 00:45:05,920
Ramil.

689
00:45:06,000 --> 00:45:07,240
Stop.

690
00:45:11,160 --> 00:45:12,400
Oh my.

691
00:45:12,480 --> 00:45:13,360
Where is Hathaya?

692
00:45:15,080 --> 00:45:16,840
I asked where she is.

693
00:45:16,920 --> 00:45:17,960
I don't know.

694
00:45:18,040 --> 00:45:20,680
You're lying. You just told me
she already left.

695
00:45:20,760 --> 00:45:23,160
I really thought she had gone home.

696
00:45:23,240 --> 00:45:25,360
If anything happens to Hathaya,

697
00:45:27,360 --> 00:45:28,880
you're responsible.

698
00:45:33,080 --> 00:45:36,200
Chayanee. Ramil came back to help Hathaya.

699
00:45:36,280 --> 00:45:38,640
What do we do?

700
00:45:39,480 --> 00:45:41,000
By the time he finds her…

701
00:45:45,880 --> 00:45:47,520
Help!

702
00:45:47,600 --> 00:45:48,680
Help me!

703
00:45:49,680 --> 00:45:51,520
Don't waste your voice.

704
00:45:52,640 --> 00:45:54,000
Save it for when I get serious.

705
00:45:55,240 --> 00:45:56,600
Help.

706
00:45:56,680 --> 00:45:58,480
I told you not to use your voice.

707
00:46:03,240 --> 00:46:04,160
Ramil!

708
00:46:14,200 --> 00:46:16,080
Get lost!

709
00:46:19,320 --> 00:46:20,680
Stop!

710
00:46:20,760 --> 00:46:22,640
-Get him up.
-Ramil.

711
00:46:22,720 --> 00:46:25,280
So tough, huh? Bring him here.

712
00:46:25,360 --> 00:46:26,520
Let me see the face of this tough guy.

713
00:46:28,400 --> 00:46:30,120
What were you thinking?

714
00:46:40,440 --> 00:46:41,440
Ramil.

715
00:46:42,400 --> 00:46:44,520
Get up if you're so tough.

716
00:46:45,160 --> 00:46:46,680
Not so strong now, are you?

717
00:46:47,200 --> 00:46:48,320
Hey.

718
00:46:49,280 --> 00:46:50,640
Get up.

719
00:46:52,320 --> 00:46:54,080
Well?

720
00:46:54,160 --> 00:46:55,400
Don't touch me.

721
00:46:56,480 --> 00:46:58,440
Enough. Enough!

722
00:47:02,160 --> 00:47:04,720
Please don't hurt him. I'm begging you.

723
00:47:04,800 --> 00:47:07,400
Stop. Please.

724
00:47:07,480 --> 00:47:08,880
Stop!

725
00:47:08,960 --> 00:47:11,720
Take this!

726
00:47:11,800 --> 00:47:14,240
Don't hurt him.

727
00:47:23,560 --> 00:47:25,320
Chayanee.

728
00:47:25,400 --> 00:47:28,760
I don't want to stay here anymore.
Let's go home.

729
00:47:29,800 --> 00:47:33,160
-Stop. Please.
-What?

730
00:47:33,240 --> 00:47:34,680
Enough. Don't hurt him.

731
00:47:35,760 --> 00:47:37,160
Stop, please.

732
00:47:38,040 --> 00:47:39,000
I'm begging you.

733
00:47:39,760 --> 00:47:41,160
You love him that much?

734
00:47:46,200 --> 00:47:47,440
Hey.

735
00:47:50,200 --> 00:47:52,120
Come here.

736
00:47:53,400 --> 00:47:54,480
Come with me.

737
00:47:55,920 --> 00:47:57,160
Over here.

738
00:47:59,000 --> 00:48:02,120
Here. This place is perfect.

739
00:48:03,520 --> 00:48:05,440
You love him that much?

740
00:48:05,520 --> 00:48:06,800
Hm?

741
00:48:06,880 --> 00:48:08,040
You love him?

742
00:48:10,800 --> 00:48:11,960
Then hurry up.

743
00:48:12,480 --> 00:48:15,000
If you want me to let him go,

744
00:48:15,840 --> 00:48:16,880
come here.

745
00:48:21,320 --> 00:48:22,160
Come on.

746
00:48:25,880 --> 00:48:27,840
I don't like women who refuse me.

747
00:48:30,240 --> 00:48:31,600
Hurry up!

748
00:48:34,080 --> 00:48:35,480
-Come here.
-Don't.

749
00:48:36,680 --> 00:48:38,280
You're dying and still want her?

750
00:48:38,360 --> 00:48:39,480
Hold him.

751
00:48:39,560 --> 00:48:41,040
Ramil.

752
00:48:42,760 --> 00:48:44,320
I'll do what you want. I'll do it.

753
00:48:44,400 --> 00:48:46,440
No. Hathaya.

754
00:48:46,520 --> 00:48:49,600
-Hathaya, don't!
-Hold him down.

755
00:48:50,760 --> 00:48:52,000
Hathaya, don't go.

756
00:48:52,080 --> 00:48:54,600
Come on. Don't make this difficult.

757
00:48:55,640 --> 00:48:58,120
I don't like women who refuse me.

758
00:48:58,200 --> 00:49:00,640
Come on.

759
00:49:03,760 --> 00:49:05,440
Make sure your men stay well hidden

760
00:49:06,000 --> 00:49:07,320
or it will be a big problem.

761
00:49:07,400 --> 00:49:08,920
And don't get careless.

762
00:49:09,000 --> 00:49:10,680
If anything happens,

763
00:49:10,760 --> 00:49:12,160
don't drag me into it.

764
00:49:12,240 --> 00:49:13,840
If we can't get rid of Hathaya,

765
00:49:13,920 --> 00:49:15,800
then we'll go after her mother instead.

766
00:49:15,880 --> 00:49:16,960
Aren't you going to eat?

767
00:49:17,040 --> 00:49:18,360
It still hurts.

768
00:49:19,240 --> 00:49:22,000
Whenever I hold a spoon, I get

769
00:49:22,720 --> 00:49:24,440
this sharp pain.

770
00:49:24,520 --> 00:49:27,320
It's already this late, and I still
can't get in touch with Mom.

771
00:49:27,400 --> 00:49:30,200
NEXT EPISODE

772
00:51:25,880 --> 00:51:29,800
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
